  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEAN-Australia Smart Cities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ASEAN Australia Smart Cities initiative (AASCI) was announced at the ASEAN-Australia Special Summit in March 2018, to support ASEAN Member States develop city systems in smart and sustainable ways. This investment supports a new partnership with the Asia Development Bank for an ASEAN Australia Smart Cities Trust Fund (AASCTF). The expected outcome of the AASCTF is the adoption and adaptation of digital solutions, systems and governance in participating ASEAN cities.</narrative>
  </description>
